id=a52sxq_no_native_zygote
name=Galaxy A52s 5G: no native isolated services (Chrome uses its Java sandbox)
author=kusti420
description=Android 17 starts services declared android:nativeService + isolatedProcess (Chrome's NativeOnlySandboxedProcessService) through the new zygote_next native zygote. On this port its child spawn fails, so ActivityManager:procStart blocks until the watchdog restarts the system. Resolve such services as not found and never route a service record to or prewarm the native zygote. Chrome 154+ binds the native-only renderer service with no fallback, so bindServiceLocked first redirects those binds to the matching Java SandboxedProcessService<N> (Chrome's own fallback swap).
